{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299652-open-letter-about-the-chronicles-of-darkness-onyx-path-beast-and-the-future","id":1299652,"title":"Open letter about the Chronicles of Darkness, Onyx Path, Beast and the future","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-03-25T10:48:57-07:00","id":1299652,"title":"Open letter about the Chronicles of Darkness, Onyx Path, Beast and the future","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ok, let's do this thing.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I feel like it's time for me to be open about some things and try get something good out a bad situation.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Turns out there was a damn valid reason I felt awful in last bunch of months. Now I'm fighting the thing, but there's a chance I won't win. A minor one, admittedly, but still big enough for the doctors to be frank about it. Still enough to be scared.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">To be honest, it's not something I wanted to discuss. I told only a few people and I'm afraid sharing it here might not be the best idea. I'm afraid it would look like attention-seeking, I'm afraid it might be inappropriate and hurt my freelancing future, and I'm afraid people will take it the wrong way. But I also lost 15 kilograms in 30 days, so I have plenty to be afraid of right now. So I hope it will still be worth it.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now I'll talk a bit about Onyx Path.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I know loyalty to brands is rarely smart in the modern world, but Onyx Path shaped half of my life, so here we are. Onyx Path is not perfect, nothing is, but it still earned our love. I've wanted to write for it for 14 years and think its products and history are among the best of the industry</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now, I can't talk about the company when I did not work for it, can't talk about experiences that aren't mine. But the Onyx Path I saw? That one is awesome. And I'm not saying it because they gave me a chance (though, hey, that felt good), but rather because I honestly believe the people that work within it right now are among the kindest, most talented people I've ever seen. Things are done the right way by the right people and each project is filled to the brim by passionate folk who wish nothing but the best for those they work with, their fans and the games they're writing. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Naive? Maybe, but that's what I think.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Onyx Path I got to know has a great future in front of it, where it will keep improving. Believe in it.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now let's talk about Beast. I carefully cultivated to reputation of \u201cBeast guy\u201d around here, with its pros and cons, so I feel like I need to cover the topic.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Beast is not perfect. Beast is a mess. Beast has been criticized by cool people who talk because they know what they're saying. People better than me. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I still love that game. I see what it is, what it can be and I see what it says to me and others, no matter its flaws.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now, and here's some unusual pride, I think I get how Beast should be written, what it should cover and the right tone to be honest about its protagonists while still providing a good game with conflicts and depth. Just as I can understand it, so do others. Talented people who write better than me and have a better idea of how to make a game great.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Beast will become the game I see when I look at it, eventually, because of Onyx Path and the people who run it or write for it</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">This company, this community and many of those who might read this, you're good people and part of a promising future. I've been around here for almost 15 years and being here, dreaming of becoming a Onyx Path writer and interacting with all of you has made me a better person and artist.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The idea I still have the opportunity to work on more books and maybe, someday, get good and respected enough to become a developer and help the company I love improve further is pretty much the goal that's helping me fight through all of this</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hey, it might not happen. I might not get more assignments (with this thread possibly being what screws me), I might not be a good enough writer. Hell, I might not be there </span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>at all</i></span></span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>.</i> But I'll still love these books and the good people who surround them as much as I'm allowed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Chronicles of Darkness are good. The World of Darkness is good. Scion is good. They Came from Beneath the Sea! is a thing. Bloodlines 2 is happening. Signs of Sorcery and Shunned by the Moon are close. Not to mention Critical Role just made <i>all </i>the money and L.A. by Night is doing great: our hobby is going through a Renaissance.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I'm thankful for many of you and the time spent here. I hope this was not as pathetic as a side of me insists it is.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I hope it helps you to see the future I see when I think of Onyx Path. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And if in the future I show you a tattoo of the Beast skull on my arm, it will mean I won my humble battle.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now, time to tag some people: </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4433_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4433\" data-vbnamecard=\"4433\">Second Chances</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar309_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"309\" data-vbnamecard=\"309\">White Oak Dragon</a>, you're the best colleagues I could ask for and I'm glad to call both of you friends.</span></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar99_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"99\" data-vbnamecard=\"99\">ArcaneArts</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar192_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"192\" data-vbnamecard=\"192\">Yossarian</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar10397_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"10397\" data-vbnamecard=\"10397\">ajf115</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar617_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"617\" data-vbnamecard=\"617\">Heavy Arms</a> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4152\" data-vbnamecard=\"4152\">Arcanist</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2207-caladriu\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"2207\" data-vbnamecard=\"2207\">Caladriu</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7920