"4443\">GibberingEloquence</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1423_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1423\" data-vbnamecard=\"1423\">espritdecalmar</a> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1329_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1329\" data-vbnamecard=\"1329\">ElvesofZion</a> r , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar177_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"177\" data-vbnamecard=\"177\">TheCountAlucard</a> , <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12970-gellydog\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12970_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12970\" data-vbnamecard=\"12970\">Gellydog</a> you're awesome, smart people and make this place better. Yeah, I know some of you did not interact much with me, but I'm a lurker at heart and carefully look to what happens around me. I know what I'm saying.<br /> <br /> I'm sure I missed some of you: I'll add more as they come to my mind.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Not tagging developers and other &quot;big&quot; writers, it's a bit too shameless for me, but the same respect and thankfulness goes to you. If you're reading this, thank you and good luck for what will come, whether I\u2019m part of it or not. If this thread was a big mistake, don't hesitate to tell me)</span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 03-28-2019, 03:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":35}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T11:25:05-07:00","id":1299661,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a>, your posts always leave me with the best impression of you and reading your essays is always a pleasure. I hope whatever is wrong with your body, you get to kill it. Kill it with chemistry, radiation or knives. Kill it dead, eat its heart and use its strength to stay awesome. Take care!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T11:54:38-07:00","id":1299671,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> Best of luck to you man. Whatever it is you must face, kick its ass and show it who's boss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T12:12:46-07:00","id":1299684,"title":"","content":"do whatever you can to win <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a>. we all believe you can do it","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T13:12:50-07:00","id":1299704,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> I've long appreciated your thoughts and insight on the forums, and I was glad to see someone delve and ponder into the potential of something that came out so poorly despite the good intentions of multiple people who worked in it. I'm thankful for whatever you might have contributed to Chronicles and Onyx Path, and I hope and believe you'll come back from this, whatever harm it may be. Look out for yourself in the meantime!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/188-yeoflittlefaith","name":"YeOfLittleFaith","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar188_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1159"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T13:35:31-07:00","id":1299713,"title":"","content":"After reading this <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> I spent a lot of time thinking about the similarities between us, and that long talk we had on Discord. In instances like this I wish I studied something more applicable to real life, that I could offer you something real, something that could help, rather than ink, charms, and spells that I hold no belief in.<br /> <br /> For whatever it is worth, I want you to know I am thinking of you, and thinking of our discussion. I'm honoured you would think to include me in this note to everyone, and if you ever need to talk about anything, or if you just want a story, please just let me know.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Scion 2e Homebrew Projects:<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BUnAIZEDk4Zs_W0ELfffeFRAiSel3nAl/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The \u0160iune\u0161</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1MMw0vBmHdvuGUbVhyFw7BpXT49UgECnR/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Enduri</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1CZuVp5VuftwuwHtzrWADqIaq7Vl-LMIr/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Sg\u0101\u2019na Qeda\u2019s</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17piJ8ZBzvt4PL47vz5Gw3BF6HOZelrfh/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">The Abosom</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/282712/Lebor-Oe-In-Dea?src=newest_community\" target=\"_blank\">Lebor \u00d3e In Dea</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1rk9BKLqbUEroFDvuPSQOwp-pBRxSvN9P/view\" target=\"_blank\">The Zemi</a>, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/324026/Nemetondevos-Revised\" target=\"_blank\">Nemetondevos: Revised</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/325461/Mysteries-of-the-Otherworld\" target=\"_blank\">Mysteries of the Otherworld</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/394-watcher","name":"Watcher","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"662"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T14:05:09-07:00","id":1299727,"title":"","content":"We are so glad to work with you Cinder. Hopefully it is the first of many. I'm so glad to have been able to read take inspiration from everything you've written over the years. Take care of yourself and if you need to chat, you know where to find me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T15:05:38-07:00","id":1299746,"title":"","content":"It's been a pleasure talking with you when I could, and my sincerest hopes for your wellbeing go to you. I hope to see many more conversations with you.<br /> <br /> *<i>raises glass*</i> <br /> <br /> To you, Cinder.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T16:15:58-07:00","id":1299760,"title":"","content":"I've fully enjoyed your posts <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> and I count you as one of the ones that make these forums and the words you write what they are in all they're awesomeness.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T18:07:27-07:00","id":1299799,"title":"","content":"I am sorry to hear that you are really sick, Cinder. You are a cool guy. My dad got really sick once so I can say that I empathize with you, man. Just know I am praying for you. May Jesus heal you soon. Peace out, bro.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7106-extant-reality","name":"Extant Reality","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7106_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-25T22:09:43-07:00","id":1299858,"title":"","content":"I've been trying to think of what is the most appropriate response to such a humbling, grave, and heavy post....<br /> <br /> ...and I really just find I keep coming back around to Edna.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/UBfb77G47hU?t=31\" data-code=\"UBfb77G47hU\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/UBfb77G47hU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> I look forward to seeing the tattoo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T00:37:37-07:00","id":1299877,"title":"","content":"Wishing you the best.<br /> <br /> I'm really looking forward to your work. ^.^","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T03:27:13-07:00","id":1299896,"title":"","content":"Cinder, you are a fine writer and a good friend. Whenever I see one of your posts on the forums, I\u2019m confident it will be well worth the effort to read. I can\u2019t begin to say how delighted I was when I learned that you\u2019d been hired for an official project, and it has been an honor and a privilege to work with you on it. I can only hope it is the first of many, and years from now we can all sit around chattering about our first project together and all the ones that came after. I\u2019m sorry you are facing this ordeal, and I pray you will conquer it and emerge stronger than ever. If you need someone to talk to, you know how to find me, and even if you don\u2019t, know that I\u2019m cheering you on from a distance. You can do this!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Jason Ross Inczauskis</b>, Freelance Writer<br /> Projects: <i>Dark Eras 2</i>, <i>Mummy: The Curse 2e, Book of Lasting Death, DtR The Clades Companion, Pirates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T05:12:09-07:00","id":1299909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299652-open-letter-about-the-chronicles-of-darkness-onyx-path-beast-and-the-future#post1299652\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ok, let's do this thing.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I feel like it's time for me to be open about some things and try get something good out a bad situation.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Turns out there was a damn valid reason I felt awful in last bunch of months. Now I'm fighting the thing, but there's a chance I won't win. A minor one, admittedly, but still big enough for the doctors to be frank about it. Still enough to be scared.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">To be honest, it's not something I wanted to discuss. I told only a few people and I'm afraid sharing it here might not be the best idea. I'm afraid it would look like attention-seeking, I'm afraid it might be inappropriate and hurt my freelancing future, and I'm afraid people will take it the wrong way. But I also lost 15 kilograms in 30 days, so I have plenty to be afraid of right now. So I hope it will still be worth it.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now I'll talk a bit about Onyx Path.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I know loyalty to brands is rarely smart in the modern world, but Onyx Path shaped half of my life, so here we are. Onyx Path is not perfect, nothing is, but it still earned our love. I've wanted to write for it for 14 years and think its products and history are among the best of the industry</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now, I can't talk about the company when I did not work for it, can't talk about experiences that aren't mine. But the Onyx Path I saw? That one is awesome. And I'm not saying it because they gave me a chance (though, hey, that felt good), but rather because I honestly believe the people that work within it right now are among the kindest, most talented people I've ever seen. Things are done the right way by the right people and each project is filled to the brim by passionate folk who wish nothing but the best for those they work with, their fans and the games they're writing. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Naive? Maybe, but that's what I think.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Onyx Path I got to know has a great future in front of it, where it will keep improving. Believe in it.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now let's talk about Beast. I carefully cultivated to reputation of \u201cBeast guy\u201d around here, with its pros and cons, so I feel like I need to cover the topic.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Beast is not perfect. Beast is a mess. Beast has been criticized by cool people who talk because they know what they're saying. People better than me. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I still love that game. I see what it is, what it can be and I see what it says to me and others, no matter its flaws.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now, and here's some unusual pride, I think I get how Beast should be written, what it should cover and the right tone to be honest about its protagonists while still providing a good game with conflicts and depth. Just as I can understand it, so do others. Talented people who write better than me and have a better idea of how to make a game great.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Beast will become the game I see when I look at it, eventually, because of Onyx Path and the people who run it or write for it</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">This company, this community and many of those who might read this, you're good people and part of a promising future. I've been around here for almost 15 years and being here, dreaming of becoming a Onyx Path writer and interacting with all of you has made me a better person and artist.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The idea I still have the opportunity to work on more books and maybe, someday, get good and respected enough to become a developer and help the company I love improve further is pretty much the goal that's helping me fight through all of this</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Hey, it might not happen. I might not get more assignments (with this thread possibly being what screws me), I might not be a good enough writer. Hell, I might not be there </span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>at all</i></span></span></i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>.</i> But I'll still love these books and the good people who surround them as much as I'm allowed.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Chronicles of Darkness are good. The World of Darkness is good. Scion is good. They Came from Beneath the Sea! is a thing. Bloodlines 2 is happening. Signs of Sorcery and Shunned by the Moon are close. Not to mention Critical Role just made <i>all </i>the money and L.A. by Night is doing great: our hobby is going through a Renaissance.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I'm thankful for many of you and the time spent here. I hope this was not as pathetic as a side of me insists it is.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I hope it helps you to see the future I see when I think of Onyx Path. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And if in the future I'll show you a tattoo of the Beast skull on my arm, it means I won my humble battle.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Now, time to tag some people: </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, you're the best colleagues I could ask for and I'm glad to call both of you friends.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span>, <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> r , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> , <span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> you're awesome, smart people and make this place better. Yeah, I know some of you did not interact much with me, but I'm a lurker at heart and carefully look to what happens around me. I know what I'm saying.<br /> <br /> I'm sure I missed some of you: I'll add more as they come to my mind.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">(Not tagging developers and other &amp;quot;big&amp;quot; writers, it's a bit too shameless for me, but the same respect and thankfulness goes to you. If you're reading this, thank you and good luck for what will come, whether I\u2019m part of it or not. If this thread was a big mistake, don't hesitate to tell me)</span></span></div> </div> </div> </div> I don't see anything disrespectful to Onyx Path, so I don't think it will hurt your chances of getting more assignments. <br /> <br /> I wish better health, I will pray for you if you wish it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T07:36:38-07:00","id":1299948,"title":"","content":"Seeing your work on this forum has been an immense pleasure, Cinder, and I was incredibly happy when I saw that Onyx Path had made the wise decision to hire you as a writer. I'm positive that, whatever you are going through, you can overcome it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T07:54:59-07:00","id":1299951,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> we haven't interacted directly much, and I'm quite the lurker myself, but you are a phenomenal writer and I really respect how much passion you throw into your writing for Beast. I just got out of a health crisis myself and damn is it ever scary at first, but then it lapses into, frankly, boredom and dark sarcastic humour. Fighting doesn't have to be dramatic. Strength and resistance can be quiet. Hang in there and take care of yourself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T08:12:09-07:00","id":1299961,"title":"","content":"From my point of view, passing trough a &quot;personal horror&quot; could only make you a better writer, Onyx path member would surely understand it.<br /> I don t think that talking to friends and other people about what scares you it s something to blame, it only means that you are a perfectly normal human being.<br /> Good luck with your battle and with your future works!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T11:53:07-07:00","id":1300020,"title":"","content":"I just wanted to thank all of you for the kind response to this thread. It was an heartfelt post I made because I sincerely thougth it could have a positive impact on our place and community, but my anxiety alarms rang like hell as I wrote and posted it and I doubt they'll ever stop.<br /> <br /> But the way those who replied to it have taken it, your encouragement and kind words, really made me feel better about it.<br /> <br /> Thanks to everyone, really.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:28:16-07:00","id":1300058,"title":"","content":"Being honest and open, in a public forum, is one of the hardest things people manage to do, it's not pathetic, especially considering the fight you're putting up. We haven't been on the same side of every conversation point but I've appreciated your insight and at times infectious interest in things, as well as your creations.<br /> <br /> Stay strong, man.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:33:53-07:00","id":1300062,"title":"","content":"I don't think we've had any contact before but I just want to wish you the best!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T13:48:34-07:00","id":1300068,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> <br /> <br /> Others have expressed their well-wishes more eloquently than me, but do believe me when I say I want you to have a full recovery soon. <br /> <br /> From the bottom of my heart, thanks for all your insights, creations and being a cool dude!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-26T14:32:45-07:00","id":1300094,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> , we certainly haven't interacted as much as I would like. I always read your big write ups and wish I had time to collaborate more. I will make an effort to do so in the future. I hope everything works out for you with what ever is going on. And if you need someone to talk to always feel free to DM me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>(he/him/his)<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Backer #2010","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1329-elvesofzion","name":"ElvesofZion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1329_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1086"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T08:02:50-07:00","id":1300280,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar38_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"38\" data-vbnamecard=\"38\">Cinder</a> I'm sorry to hear about you going through some shit and I hope you all the best. Thanks for the shout-out; it actually means a lot to me realizing that I've been on these sites for such a long time and have made a difference, however small.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T21:41:53-07:00","id":1300466,"title":"","content":"Hey, we've never interacted much outside of like a short Twitter thread or something, but your writings had a huge impact on how I ran my Beast campaign and has made it objectively better, I think. Best wishes for a good recovery, you've got a lot of people cheering you on, me included.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raziel MacPhereson, he/they | <a href=\"http://twitter.com/beastsoulfury\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a> | <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Raziel%20MacPhereson\" target=\"_blank\">STV Content</a> | <a href=\"https://huntunderironskies.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Tumblr</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23812-cherubic","name":"Cherubic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23812_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-03-27T21:48:16-07:00","id":1300467,"title":"","content":"It's been a treat to see your thoughts on the books over the years, and I'm glad to have your appreciation.<br /> <br /> Pulling for you to get through this thing. Looking forward to seeing that ink.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d